Package: descriptiveStats
Title: Descriptive Statistics for Numeric Vectors
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Dilpreet", "Bahia", , role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The package calculates descriptive statistics. It calculates mean,
    median, mode, quartiles, and interquartile range. It handles empty vectors,
    NA values and single values.
